    "sentence_translations": [
      "14. Epilogue",
      "",
      "In Japan, there is a train station in front of which there is a dog statue.",
      "This statue is to remind people of a dog named “Hachiko”.",
      "Hachiko was born in 1923.",
      "Every day, he would watch his owner go to work, and in the evening, he would go to the station to meet his owner and return home together.",
      "The owner later fell ill and died, but Hachiko still went to the station every day to wait for him.",
      "Hachiko waited for nine years. In 1935, he also died.",
      "",
      "Hachiko’s story has touched many people.",
      "Now, the Hachiko Statue in front of the station is a very famous place in Japan.",
      "People have also made a movie out of Hachiko’s story.",
      "Our story “Forever Faithful: A Dog’s Story” is also derived from Hachiko’s story."
    ]
